{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30355","headline":"淮信贺滕迈台州 · 赵嘏","name":"淮信贺滕迈台州","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"凋瘵民思太古风，上贤绥辑副宸衷。\n舟移清镜禹祠北，路转翠屏天姥东。\n旌斾影前横竹马，咏歌声里乐樵童。\n遥知到郡沧波晏，三岛离离一望中。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"赵嘏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_30355.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30355","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}